        SR-Scientist: Scientific Equation Discovery With <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> AI
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xia%2C+S">Shijie Xia</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sun%2C+Y">Yuhan Sun</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+P">Pengfei Liu</a>
      
